OL,3,ALola Young surprises Reading Festival
OL,4,Awith final day set
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans at the final day of Reading
OL,7,FFestival were treated to a surprise set
OL,8,Ffrom singer Lola Young.
OL,10,F"I am backstage, the cat is out of the
OL,11,Fbag and I am going to be performing so
OL,12,Fsee you... at the Grid stage," she
OL,13,Fteased on Instagram, before treating
OL,14,Ffans to hits including number one
OL,15,Fsingle Messy and One Thing.
OL,17,FHer performance marks the latest step
OL,18,Fin a return to the spotlight after she
OL,19,Fhad to cancel a string of shows last
OL,20,Fyear following an on-stage collapse in
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
